        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>蒸馏操作与质量守恒定律验证</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']] },\n      svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      background: #fff;\n      color: #333;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    }\n    body {\n      width: 540px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 24px 38px 10px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.65;\n    }\n    .title {\n      width: max-content;\n      margin: 0 auto 5px;\n      padding: 1px 7px;\n      background: #12a8d9;\n      color: #fff;\n      font-family: \"SimHei\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      line-height: 1.35;\n    }\n    .apparatus {\n      height: 101px;\n      width: 355px;\n      margin: 0 auto 5px;\n      position: relative;\n      border: 0;\n    }\n    .apparatus:after {\n      content: \"[蒸馏装置图]\";\n      position: absolute;\n      inset: 0;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      color: #555;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 14%, #777 14% 15%, transparent 15% 26%, #777 26% 27%, transparent 27% 49%, #777 49% 50%, transparent 50% 63%, #777 63% 64%, transparent 64% 82%, #777 82% 83%, transparent 83%),\n        linear-gradient(#fff, #fafafa);\n      opacity: .75;\n    }\n    .items { margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n    .items p, .experiment-text p {\n      margin: 1px 0;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .red {\n      color: #e33b3b;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      text-decoration: underline;\n      text-decoration-color: #e33b3b;\n      text-decoration-thickness: 1px;\n      text-underline-offset: 2px;\n    }\n    .section-title {\n      width: max-content;\n      margin: 4px auto 4px;\n      padding: 1px 7px;\n      background: #13a8d8;\n      color: #fff;\n      font-family: \"SimHei\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      line-height: 1.35;\n    }\n    .experiment-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr 82px;\n      gap: 7px;\n      align-items: end;\n      height: 104px;\n      margin: 0 0 3px;\n    }\n    .experiment {\n      height: 90px;\n      position: relative;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n    .experiment .drawing {\n      height: 73px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #555;\n      position: relative;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(170deg, transparent 0 54%, #555 55% 56%, transparent 57%),\n        linear-gradient(10deg, transparent 0 57%, #555 58% 59%, transparent 60%);\n    }\n    .experiment .drawing:before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 24%;\n      right: 24%;\n      bottom: 9px;\n      height: 17px;\n      border: 1px solid #555;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n    }\n    .experiment .drawing:after {\n      content: \"[装置图]\";\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 25px;\n      left: 0;\n      right: 0;\n      color: #555;\n      font-size: 11px;\n    }\n    .experiment.photo .drawing {\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 43%, #aaa 0 5%, transparent 6%),\n        linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 42%, #eee 43% 48%, #555 49% 52%, #eee 53% 57%, transparent 58%),\n        linear-gradient(75deg, transparent 41%, #666 42% 47%, #eee 48% 53%, #555 54% 58%, transparent 59%),\n        #777;\n      border: 0;\n    }\n    .experiment.photo .drawing:after {\n      content: \"\";\n    }\n    .experiment-label {\n      display: block;\n      margin-top: 1px;\n    }\n    .experiment-text {\n      margin-top: 1px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.65;\n    }\n    .equation {\n      font-style: italic;\n      font-family: \"Times New Roman\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n    }\n    .footer {\n      margin-top: 4px;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 8px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: #222;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"title\">八、蒸馏操作</div>\n\n  <div class=\"apparatus placeholder\" aria-label=\"蒸馏装置图\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"items\">\n    <p>1.蒸馏是利用液体的<span class=\"red\">沸点</span>不同，分离液体混合物。</p>\n    <p>2.碎瓷片的作用：<span class=\"red\">防止液体暴沸</span>。</p>\n    <p>3.冷凝水的流向：<span class=\"red\">下进，上出</span>，以使冷凝管中充满冷水。</p>\n    <p>4.开始馏出的液体为<span class=\"red\">沸点较低的成分</span>，应当弃去。</p>\n    <p>5.简易蒸馏装置中长导管的作用是<span class=\"red\">导气和冷凝</span>。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">九、质量守恒定律验证</div>\n\n  <div class=\"experiment-grid\">\n    <div class=\"experiment\">\n      <div class=\"drawing placeholder\" aria-label=\"实验1装置图\"></div>\n      <span class=\"experiment-label\">实验1</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"experiment\">\n      <div class=\"drawing placeholder\" aria-label=\"实验2装置图\"></div>\n      <span class=\"experiment-label\">实验2</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"experiment\">\n      <div class=\"drawing placeholder\" aria-label=\"实验3装置图\"></div>\n      <span class=\"experiment-label\">实验3</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"experiment photo\">\n      <div class=\"drawing placeholder\" aria-label=\"实验4图\"></div>\n      <span class=\"experiment-label\">实验4</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"experiment-text\">\n    <p>1．实验1的现象　<span class=\"red\">冒气泡，产生大量气泡，气球先膨胀后变瘪</span>。</p>\n    <p>气球的作用是　<span class=\"red\">将反应物分隔开</span>。</p>\n    <p>锥形瓶底放一些细沙的目的是<span class=\"red\">防止锥形瓶炸裂</span>。反应后，天平是否平衡？<span class=\"red\">是</span>。</p>\n\n    <p>2．实验2的现象是<span class=\"red\">铁钉表面出现红色固体，溶液由蓝色变成浅绿色</span>，</p>\n    <p>化学方程式　<span class=\"red equation\">CuSO<sub>4</sub>+Fe=FeSO<sub>4</sub>+Cu</span>。反应后，天平是否平衡？<span class=\"red\">是</span>。</p>\n\n    <p>3．实验3结束天平是否平衡？<span class=\"red\">否</span>。原因是<span class=\"red\">反应中产生了气体逸出</span>。</p>\n    <p>如何改进装置以验证质量守恒定律？<span class=\"red\">在密闭容器中进行实验</span>。</p>\n\n    <p>4．实验4：反应前称量镁条和石棉网质量，反应后称量石棉网和燃烧后得到的</p>\n    <p>产物的质量。</p>\n    <p>①如果测得反应后质量比反应前质量大，原因 <span class=\"red\">增加了氧元素的质量</span>。</p>\n    <p>②如果测得反应后质量比反应前质量小，原因 <span class=\"red\">镁条燃烧时形成白烟逸散到空气中</span>。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">6 / 13</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
